WEBVTT

01:24.960 --> 01:27.360
ADAPTED FROM
THE LEGEND OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:34.440 --> 01:35.280
ZHENG ZHIXING'S MEMORIAL TABLET

01:35.360 --> 01:38.160
My brother only had two sons,

01:38.960 --> 01:41.720
but they were both involved
in the case of selling stolen goods.

01:42.800 --> 01:45.240
As the family head and clan head,

01:46.160 --> 01:48.040
he let his sons take the fall.

01:48.120 --> 01:48.960
ZHENG ZHIHENG'S MEMORIAL TABLET

01:49.040 --> 01:50.560
That's too much.

01:51.080 --> 01:54.320
Although Si and Wu are guilty,

01:54.400 --> 01:56.760
they are the Zheng family's children.

01:57.720 --> 02:00.280
What he did…

02:01.720 --> 02:04.920
…was unworthy of a father.

02:05.640 --> 02:08.680
You have a point.

02:15.880 --> 02:17.480
You are responsible elders.

02:18.800 --> 02:21.280
You have pity on the deceased Si and Wu.

02:22.080 --> 02:23.680
You opened the ancestral hall

02:24.200 --> 02:26.120
and brought their memorial tablets back.

02:27.880 --> 02:29.360
But Mr. Zheng…

02:30.880 --> 02:34.360
He left the family business behind
and disappeared.

02:35.280 --> 02:37.920
I don't know what to do.

02:39.680 --> 02:40.920
Now,

02:42.160 --> 02:45.000
it's time for you to salvage the situation

02:45.080 --> 02:47.080
and calm the Zheng family.

02:49.000 --> 02:52.720
Uncle, Mr. Zheng is the only elder

02:53.400 --> 02:54.960
in the clan.

02:57.720 --> 02:59.160
That is…

02:59.240 --> 03:01.200
Lady Yu is still there.

03:03.480 --> 03:05.360
After Si died,

03:06.920 --> 03:10.960
my aunt, Lady Cui, went to a nunnery.

03:12.040 --> 03:13.400
Now,

03:15.480 --> 03:17.120
Wu is also dead.

03:19.760 --> 03:22.000
Let's send Lady Yu away.

03:22.920 --> 03:24.240
It's in line with the rules

03:24.760 --> 03:25.840
and a good deed.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.760
Inspector Zhang came to us
again and again.

03:31.840 --> 03:34.040
Mr. Zheng won't come back.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.520
Even if he comes back,

03:36.600 --> 03:38.280
the people in the clan

03:38.360 --> 03:41.520
will be more inclined to you
because of his mistakes.

03:47.440 --> 03:50.120
Please make the decision.

03:53.800 --> 03:54.960
All right.

03:56.120 --> 04:00.680
Let's send Lady Yu away.

04:02.320 --> 04:04.000
You make the decision.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.640
I'll support you.

04:09.280 --> 04:10.480
Thank you.

04:10.560 --> 04:13.240
You're welcome.

04:13.880 --> 04:15.600
You take care of yourself.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.000
Wu.

04:45.760 --> 04:46.760
Wu.

04:48.120 --> 04:50.000
Watch it above there.

04:59.760 --> 05:00.840
Wu.

05:02.040 --> 05:06.000
I'm coming for you.

05:59.000 --> 06:00.360
Cui Shijiu.

06:02.080 --> 06:05.080
You have the nerve to show up.
You killed my son.

06:05.160 --> 06:08.000
I want you to die with him.

06:09.720 --> 06:11.680
I killed Zheng Wu,

06:11.760 --> 06:13.360
but you can't bring him back

06:14.200 --> 06:16.080
by killing me.

06:17.240 --> 06:19.200
Don't you want to die?

06:19.280 --> 06:20.920
Go to accompany him.

06:21.000 --> 06:23.280
Tell him that I'm doing well

06:23.360 --> 06:24.720
and never think of him.

06:24.800 --> 06:27.080
Without him, Zhenlang Pavilion is mine.

06:27.160 --> 06:29.720
If I get married,
Zhenlang Pavilion is my dowry.

06:29.800 --> 06:32.160
Don't even think about it.

06:33.760 --> 06:35.000
Don't even think about it.

06:40.280 --> 06:42.040
I possessed Zhenlang Pavilion,

06:43.120 --> 06:44.880
and I'm not giving it back to you.

06:45.800 --> 06:46.800
Lady Yu.

06:49.320 --> 06:50.280
Do you want revenge?

06:52.920 --> 06:54.240
If you want revenge,

06:55.080 --> 06:56.760
stay alive.

06:58.600 --> 06:59.440
Come with me.

07:03.400 --> 07:04.920
Come with you?

07:06.760 --> 07:08.280
You killed Wu.

07:09.080 --> 07:10.160
You will die…

07:12.040 --> 07:13.520
a horrible death.

07:35.320 --> 07:38.400
Wu, don't worry.

07:39.800 --> 07:42.320
I'll keep an eye on her for you.

07:42.960 --> 07:44.120
Here's the medicine for Lady Yu.

07:44.200 --> 07:46.600
She hasn't eaten or drunk for days.
She's weak.

07:46.680 --> 07:48.080
When you decoct the medicine,

07:48.160 --> 07:49.680
make some bird's nest porridge
for her. Take it.

07:53.840 --> 07:55.480
Zhenlang Pavilion.

07:56.760 --> 07:57.840
ZHENLANG PAVILION

07:57.920 --> 07:59.920
Wu's Zhenlang Pavilion.

08:01.480 --> 08:03.720
Wu and his father grew apart

08:04.480 --> 08:07.720
because of the Zhenlang Pavilion.

08:10.240 --> 08:12.240
It's all because of you.

08:17.760 --> 08:20.720
If you want to protect
Zhenlang Pavilion for Wu,

08:21.760 --> 08:23.960
you have to live longer than me.

08:59.280 --> 09:00.400
Li Kui failed.

09:00.480 --> 09:02.440
He made many people
at the Black Dragon Bandits die,

09:02.960 --> 09:04.760
and he ruined Prince Ying's business,

09:05.560 --> 09:08.520
but he's at ease.

09:09.640 --> 09:11.320
As long as I'm here,

09:11.400 --> 09:13.240
I can gather the Black Dragon Bandits.

09:13.840 --> 09:15.200
It's different from your Zheng family.

09:16.040 --> 09:17.000
Even if you're there,

09:17.760 --> 09:19.320
you're not united.

09:19.840 --> 09:22.480
Cui Shijiu entered you easily.

09:23.080 --> 09:23.960
You…

09:24.880 --> 09:27.480
Don't you see Prince Ying is calm?

09:29.400 --> 09:32.480
The impeachment
can't deal with Prince Ying.

09:34.840 --> 09:36.480
Li Kui, you know me well.

09:36.560 --> 09:37.400
I've sent people

09:37.480 --> 09:39.840
to guard all the postal stations
on the way to Chang'an.

09:39.920 --> 09:42.240
If Zhang Jinran wants to deliver
the memorial to Chang'an,

09:42.320 --> 09:44.120
he needs horses and people.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.640
In that case,

09:45.720 --> 09:46.800
he needs at least 15 days.

09:50.600 --> 09:52.880
Your Highness, Yan Zijing
went to the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

09:52.960 --> 09:54.960
He wanted to get justice for Mr. Zheng.

09:55.040 --> 09:55.920
If Mr. Zheng doesn't go there,

09:56.000 --> 09:57.160
he will smash the blood-stained pearl.

09:59.720 --> 10:00.840
Mr. Zheng.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.440
Go.

10:03.520 --> 10:04.600
Prince Ying.

10:04.680 --> 10:07.600
Zhang Jinran will capture me
when I go there.

10:07.680 --> 10:08.920
Even if he just wants me
to cooperate with the investigation,

10:09.000 --> 10:11.480
he'll keep me in jail.

10:11.560 --> 10:14.120
Don't be afraid. With Prince Ying around,

10:14.640 --> 10:16.440
no one can hurt you.

10:17.640 --> 10:20.600
The priority is to authenticate the bead.

10:22.000 --> 10:24.040
You said the blood-stained pearl
was about treasure.

10:24.120 --> 10:25.640
He won't smash it.

10:25.720 --> 10:28.280
You almost killed Su Muzhe.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.920
Will he let you go easily?

10:30.960 --> 10:31.880
-Go.
-I…

10:33.560 --> 10:35.920
-Prince Ying.
-Mr. Zheng!

10:36.520 --> 10:37.680
Go!

10:42.560 --> 10:45.760
TIME WAITS FOR NO ONE

10:45.840 --> 10:46.720
-Get out of the way!
-Mr. Zheng is here.

10:46.800 --> 10:47.840
Out of the way!

10:47.920 --> 10:48.760
-Mr. Zheng.
-Mr. Zheng.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.160
Blood-stained pearl.

10:58.120 --> 11:00.080
-Su Muzhe is not dead.
-I'm sorry.

11:00.160 --> 11:02.080
Stay back. Stay back.

11:03.480 --> 11:04.520
What's wrong?

11:05.840 --> 11:07.080
Did I scare you?

11:07.680 --> 11:08.880
I'm sorry, Mr. Zheng.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.720
I'm still alive.

11:14.720 --> 11:17.000
Duanwu!

11:17.560 --> 11:19.280
Duanwu, wake up!

11:19.800 --> 11:20.640
Duanwu!

11:20.720 --> 11:23.080
-Duanwu.
-Duanwu.

11:26.000 --> 11:27.080
Water…

11:30.120 --> 11:31.440
Water!

11:31.520 --> 11:32.680
-Water.
-Water.

11:34.760 --> 11:36.000
Here.

11:41.440 --> 11:43.280
It's okay.

11:51.440 --> 11:52.440
It's so good that you're alive.

12:03.920 --> 12:05.160
Thank you.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.600
Do you feel better?

12:13.840 --> 12:15.520
Zheng Shiyuan took away
my blood-stained pearl.

12:16.320 --> 12:17.840
I thought

12:17.920 --> 12:21.080
the blood-stained pearl
was my mother's only memento to me.

12:22.960 --> 12:24.360
Many people died

12:26.320 --> 12:27.680
because of the blood-stained pearl.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.040
It's not worth it.

12:39.920 --> 12:41.600
You've never shown the blood-stained pearl

12:41.680 --> 12:44.200
since you got to Yangzhou.

12:44.280 --> 12:47.600
Why did Zheng Shiyuan take it from you
when he caught you?

12:47.680 --> 12:49.800
He didn't pay much attention
to the blood-stained pearl.

12:49.880 --> 12:51.160
There must be someone else

12:51.680 --> 12:52.880
behind Zheng Shiyuan

12:53.400 --> 12:54.800
besides Prince Ying

12:55.320 --> 12:56.400
who wants to get the blood-stained pearl.

13:00.160 --> 13:01.560
It's the Black Dragon Bandits.

13:03.800 --> 13:06.680
Maybe it's Li Kui.

13:06.760 --> 13:08.720
Li Kui, Zheng Shiyuan, and Prince Ying

13:08.800 --> 13:09.760
are in this together.

13:09.840 --> 13:12.040
Now they have both two pearls,

13:12.560 --> 13:13.920
they will look for an opportunity to leave

13:14.560 --> 13:16.520
and find the legendary Gulistan treasure.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.840
Li Kui won't show up easily.

13:19.480 --> 13:21.160
We need to find a way to lure him out.

13:28.680 --> 13:29.680
I have an idea.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.360
What is it?

13:35.440 --> 13:37.320
I'll pretend I'm dead.

13:45.240 --> 13:46.720
In that case,

13:47.880 --> 13:49.400
I can lock down the city and search.

13:52.280 --> 13:54.280
Zheng Shiyuan is hiding.

13:54.960 --> 13:58.000
Prince Ying has to cope with us.

13:58.600 --> 14:01.280
In that case,
he can only send Li Kui to do it.

14:01.360 --> 14:05.200
And if Duanwu is alive,

14:05.720 --> 14:08.280
I can't convict him
with Prince Ying around.

14:15.800 --> 14:17.480
Directors, I'm sorry.

14:18.000 --> 14:19.080
I scared you.

14:20.960 --> 14:23.640
You're not dead. What are you doing?

14:24.160 --> 14:26.520
-Take her down!
-I dare you!

14:28.040 --> 14:29.080
Back off!

14:30.360 --> 14:31.400
Back off!

14:36.760 --> 14:38.080
Mr. Zheng.

14:38.160 --> 14:39.520
I'm not dead.

14:40.600 --> 14:41.920
I scared you.

14:42.560 --> 14:43.880
It's my fault.

14:44.560 --> 14:48.400
Mr. Zheng.
You took away Mr. Qin of Clear Mind,

14:48.480 --> 14:50.440
and you lured me out of the city

14:50.960 --> 14:52.480
and stole my treasure.

14:53.120 --> 14:55.800
You wanted to kill me and Mr. Qin.

14:56.880 --> 14:57.760
What did you want?

14:57.840 --> 15:01.920
You're slandering me. It's not true.

15:09.560 --> 15:12.640
He… Yes. It's him.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.960
As the Inspector of Huainandao,

15:15.040 --> 15:18.000
he protected Su Muzhe again and again.

15:18.600 --> 15:20.280
It wasn't enough for him
to kill my two sons.

15:20.360 --> 15:23.080
Now, they're colluding

15:23.160 --> 15:25.400
to frame me for murder.

15:27.160 --> 15:29.200
I called you here today

15:29.920 --> 15:33.640
to explain everything to you.

15:34.560 --> 15:36.320
Jubao House doesn't want others

15:36.880 --> 15:38.880
to compete with them for business.

15:39.920 --> 15:43.160
Do you remember Qin's Glass Workshop?

15:43.240 --> 15:46.480
Before, in order to suppress
the Qin's Glass Workshop,

15:46.560 --> 15:50.080
the Zheng family said they affected
the people in the neighborhood.

15:50.160 --> 15:53.160
Mr. Qin had to move his workshop
again and again.

15:53.240 --> 15:55.320
Then, he drove up the price
of raw materials

15:55.400 --> 15:58.320
and asked hooligans
to mess with his workshop

15:58.400 --> 15:59.600
to stop customers
from getting into his workshop.

15:59.680 --> 16:01.760
He ruined his family.

16:03.040 --> 16:05.760
Now, Mr. Qin is working with Clear Mind.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.080
But Mr. Zheng

16:09.600 --> 16:11.320
wanted to kill Mr. Qin and me.

16:13.840 --> 16:15.920
You have been in the jewelry guild
for a long time.

16:17.200 --> 16:19.240
Countless shops

16:19.800 --> 16:23.040
were forced to close by the Zheng family.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.560
Not to mention Qin's Glass Workshop,

16:24.640 --> 16:26.400
my Clear Mind

16:26.480 --> 16:29.400
has also been suppressed by him
many times.

16:29.480 --> 16:30.960
Three people almost died

16:31.480 --> 16:33.200
because of the Zheng family.

16:34.000 --> 16:34.920
If you

16:35.520 --> 16:36.840
don't step up

16:36.920 --> 16:39.080
like you do today,

16:39.160 --> 16:41.440
when Clear Mind is ruined,

16:42.600 --> 16:45.320
no one will speak for you.

16:46.360 --> 16:48.840
Don't take her word for it.

16:48.920 --> 16:52.440
Come on. Drive this crazy woman
out of the jewelry guild.

16:52.520 --> 16:54.000
-Drive her out.
-Zheng Shiyuan!

16:55.240 --> 16:57.360
Don't push your luck.

17:07.599 --> 17:08.839
All of the above

17:10.599 --> 17:12.760
is Clear Mind's business,

17:13.280 --> 17:14.920
and it has nothing to do with you.

17:15.680 --> 17:17.240
Do you know

17:17.319 --> 17:21.319
where your annual membership fees go?

17:22.079 --> 17:24.880
What? Did he embezzle our membership fees?

17:24.960 --> 17:25.920
As far as I know,

17:26.000 --> 17:27.440
the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild

17:27.520 --> 17:30.800
charges membership fees in three tiers.

17:31.800 --> 17:33.560
-Where is the ledger?
-Yeah.

17:33.640 --> 17:35.160
Have you seen the ledger?

17:36.920 --> 17:38.880
Can you show them the ledger?

17:40.560 --> 17:43.360
Jubao House pays a million cashes a year.

17:43.440 --> 17:44.520
They paid the most.

17:44.600 --> 17:46.280
But from what I know,

17:47.520 --> 17:49.480
you misappropriated more than that.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.920
-Mr. Zheng.
-That's a lot.

17:52.000 --> 17:53.600
Is Su Muzhe telling the truth?

17:53.680 --> 17:54.880
The membership fees

17:54.960 --> 17:56.560
are for emergency use
by the guild's merchants.

17:56.640 --> 17:57.840
How could you misappropriate it?

17:57.920 --> 17:59.200
Don't take her word for it.

17:59.280 --> 18:01.000
How could she have the ledger
of our guild?

18:01.080 --> 18:02.680
How could I have the ledger
of the jewelry guild?

18:06.080 --> 18:07.160
-Directors.
-Let me see.

18:07.240 --> 18:08.640
Directors.

18:10.560 --> 18:11.560
LEDGER OF THE JEWELRY GUILD

18:12.360 --> 18:13.760
-You rat.
-Yeah.

18:13.840 --> 18:15.240
You embezzled our money.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.120
WITHDRAW 30 MILLION MACE

18:16.800 --> 18:18.080
It's our hard-earned money.

18:18.160 --> 18:20.320
Listen to me.

18:20.840 --> 18:22.720
She faked the ledger!

18:22.800 --> 18:25.320
Look carefully!
It's written in black and white.

18:25.400 --> 18:27.200
She faked it!

18:27.280 --> 18:28.440
The ledger is not fake.

18:29.840 --> 18:30.920
I gave it to her.

18:34.840 --> 18:36.040
Cui Shijiu.

18:43.760 --> 18:46.280
When my father was in charge
of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild,

18:46.360 --> 18:48.600
we had two ledgers.

18:49.120 --> 18:50.440
Mr. Zheng,

18:51.080 --> 18:53.440
you must have followed
this unwritten rule, right?

18:55.120 --> 18:56.240
I can explain

18:56.960 --> 18:59.320
these three accounts to you.

18:59.960 --> 19:02.400
The first one, 40 million cashes.

19:02.480 --> 19:05.560
The Zheng family
hoarded beryl stones with it.

19:06.200 --> 19:09.080
The second one, 30 million cashes.

19:09.960 --> 19:11.160
He wanted to please Mr. Xu

19:11.760 --> 19:13.680
and bribed him with it

19:13.760 --> 19:15.360
at the Qionghua Festival.

19:16.760 --> 19:19.360
This third one, 20 million cashes.

19:19.440 --> 19:22.560
He bought Zhenlang Pavilion with it

19:22.640 --> 19:24.480
and gave Mr. Xu a majority stake.

19:24.560 --> 19:26.200
All three accounts

19:26.280 --> 19:29.120
have the guild head's seal on them.

19:31.080 --> 19:32.760
Cui Shijiu, don't forget

19:32.840 --> 19:34.080
that you're the legitimate daughter
of the Cui family.

19:34.160 --> 19:35.640
Wu treated you…

19:36.440 --> 19:38.520
My father had kicked me out of the house.

19:39.480 --> 19:40.760
Wu?

19:42.160 --> 19:44.000
Wu died a long time ago.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.880
You forced him to die.

19:48.080 --> 19:51.320
I have nothing to do
with your Zheng family.

19:51.840 --> 19:55.160
Remember. I'm not Cui Shijiu.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.120
I'm Cui Zhuohua.

19:57.200 --> 20:00.320
Cui Zhuohua,
the owner of Zhenlang Pavilion!

20:04.160 --> 20:06.360
The Zheng family
embezzled the guild membership fees.

20:07.480 --> 20:08.680
The ledger is the proof.

20:09.360 --> 20:13.000
As for the Zheng family's oppression
of the people

20:13.560 --> 20:15.120
and all the illegal things
they've done all these years,

20:16.040 --> 20:17.320
I can testify in person.

20:22.040 --> 20:23.640
You bully innocent people,

20:23.720 --> 20:25.960
kill people for money,
and embezzle membership fees.

20:26.040 --> 20:27.160
As merchants of the guild,

20:27.240 --> 20:30.400
how could you tolerate him
as the guild head?

20:30.480 --> 20:34.720
Dismiss Zheng Shiyuan!

20:34.800 --> 20:38.000
You're guilty of kidnapping and murder.

20:40.080 --> 20:41.200
Zheng Shiyuan.

20:41.960 --> 20:43.480
Come with me
to the Grand Governor's Office.

20:44.080 --> 20:45.280
-Take him away.
-Yes, sir.

20:49.800 --> 20:51.120
-You deserve it.
-Yeah.

20:51.200 --> 20:54.000
-He deserves to die.
-He deserves to die.

21:25.160 --> 21:26.520
Jinran.

21:26.600 --> 21:28.520
Someone reported to me

21:29.560 --> 21:32.400
that you had a private relationship
with Clear Mind's Su Muzhe.

21:32.480 --> 21:34.600
Therefore, you framed Zheng Shiyuan.

21:35.120 --> 21:37.640
You pretended to behead Xu Nanying,

21:38.160 --> 21:39.960
making a huge scandal.

21:40.480 --> 21:42.720
It's a big deal. I have to deal with it.

21:43.560 --> 21:45.520
What do you want to do?

21:51.240 --> 21:52.560
Hand over Zheng Shiyuan to me.

21:53.080 --> 21:55.240
I'll take over the case.

21:55.320 --> 21:57.880
Although you're a prince,

21:59.520 --> 22:01.480
you don't have the right to deal
with local affairs.

22:01.560 --> 22:03.320
I was commanded by the Emperor

22:03.840 --> 22:04.720
to hold the Jewel Exhibition.

22:04.800 --> 22:06.800
Xu Nanying is an Official of Yangzhou.

22:06.880 --> 22:08.640
Zheng Shiyuan
is a wealthy businessman in Yangzhou.

22:08.720 --> 22:10.000
They must be there.

22:10.080 --> 22:11.640
Why can't I deal with it?

22:13.680 --> 22:17.240
Jinran. I've always treated you
like a brother.

22:18.960 --> 22:21.880
I treated you well and recommended you.

22:21.960 --> 22:24.040
I treat you with sincerity.

22:24.120 --> 22:25.440
But you don't care

22:25.520 --> 22:27.560
about our friendship.

22:27.640 --> 22:29.440
-You disappointed me.
-Ying.

22:30.800 --> 22:32.480
You used to tell me

22:34.000 --> 22:36.400
that you wanted to rectify the officials,
solve old cases,

22:36.480 --> 22:39.600
and let the people live a clear life.

22:39.680 --> 22:42.560
Zheng Shiyuan embezzled money,
sold stolen goods, and killed people.

22:43.080 --> 22:44.280
But you want to cover for him.

22:47.600 --> 22:48.440
Come on.

22:52.800 --> 22:55.120
For the sake of our friendship,

22:56.560 --> 22:58.560
I hope you can stop it.

23:16.640 --> 23:17.560
Ying.

23:18.960 --> 23:20.200
Don't be obsessed.

23:30.240 --> 23:31.480
You tricked me.

23:39.400 --> 23:41.520
Zhang Jinran, how dare you?

23:41.600 --> 23:43.200
Where is Zheng Shiyuan?

23:43.720 --> 23:44.680
Where did you hide him?

23:47.000 --> 23:47.960
Tell me.

23:51.320 --> 23:52.680
I'll give you one last chance.

23:54.320 --> 23:55.880
Either you hand over Zheng Shiyuan

23:58.000 --> 24:00.240
or we will be enemies.

24:01.600 --> 24:03.080
We have been friends

24:08.600 --> 24:10.520
for ten years.

24:29.320 --> 24:31.640
Today, I cut my clothes.

24:34.280 --> 24:36.080
We're not friends anymore.

25:01.560 --> 25:03.280
You're cruel.

25:04.400 --> 25:07.040
When I faked my death,

25:07.120 --> 25:09.120
you didn't come to Clear Mind to mourn me.

25:09.200 --> 25:12.760
I'm not your friend.
Why should I mourn you?

25:13.280 --> 25:14.240
Besides,

25:14.320 --> 25:18.920
wouldn't you be happier
if I killed Zheng Shiyuan

25:20.040 --> 25:23.240
than if I went to Clear Mind

25:23.320 --> 25:24.440
to pretend to mourn you?

25:33.440 --> 25:35.600
You said you were not my friend,

25:36.120 --> 25:37.840
but you know me so well.

25:39.520 --> 25:40.800
You're like my confidant.

25:41.800 --> 25:42.920
My best friend.

25:46.440 --> 25:48.200
It's a pity that we only did half of it,

25:48.280 --> 25:52.200
and we didn't get
to see Zheng Shiyuan die.

25:59.680 --> 26:00.840
Cui Shijiu.

26:00.920 --> 26:06.600
Your other name… Cui Zhuohua?

26:06.680 --> 26:08.800
Cui Shijiu is a good name.

26:10.880 --> 26:15.880
The peach tree beams so red
How brilliant are its flowers!

26:16.400 --> 26:21.160
The maiden's getting red
Good for the nuptial bowers

26:22.360 --> 26:23.440
My father gave me that name

26:23.520 --> 26:25.760
because he wanted me to bring good luck

26:26.360 --> 26:28.000
to the family I would marry.

26:28.080 --> 26:31.000
My mother

26:31.080 --> 26:34.640
wanted me to have a bright life.

26:34.720 --> 26:38.200
That's why they named me Cui Zhuohua.

26:38.280 --> 26:41.400
You're Cui Zhuohua,
the owner of Zhenlang Pavilion.

26:41.480 --> 26:42.960
You threw Zheng Shiyuan,

26:43.040 --> 26:44.240
the guild head
of the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild,

26:44.320 --> 26:45.800
out of his position

26:47.880 --> 26:49.440
and became famous.

26:50.840 --> 26:51.800
Congratulations.

26:54.880 --> 26:55.880
Su Muzhe.

26:57.280 --> 26:58.520
Didn't you think

26:59.480 --> 27:01.200
I might give you a fake ledger?

27:04.920 --> 27:06.960
Cui Shijiu,
the legitimate daughter of the Cui family,

27:07.040 --> 27:07.960
may lie to me.

27:08.760 --> 27:11.040
Because she was in trouble.

27:11.560 --> 27:12.520
She only cared about the Cui family.

27:14.120 --> 27:16.040
Cui Shijiu, the abandoned daughter
of the Cui family,

27:16.120 --> 27:16.960
may also lie to me.

27:17.560 --> 27:19.640
Because she was depending
on the Zheng family.

27:19.720 --> 27:21.800
She couldn't help herself.

27:21.880 --> 27:25.280
But I don't think Cui Zhuohua,
the owner of Zhenlang Pavilion,

27:25.800 --> 27:27.240
will lie to me.

27:28.320 --> 27:30.160
Because she was conscious.

27:31.600 --> 27:33.240
She knew what she wanted.

27:35.640 --> 27:37.000
Good.

27:37.080 --> 27:38.920
Because of your words,

27:39.760 --> 27:40.840
I will toast you.

27:45.200 --> 27:46.760
Who would have thought

27:47.320 --> 27:50.320
that a pearl diver

27:50.400 --> 27:52.520
would be so successful today?

27:53.400 --> 27:56.360
It's fate.

27:56.440 --> 27:57.680
It's not fate.

28:00.600 --> 28:02.840
I used to feel very miserable

28:05.560 --> 28:08.200
when I was suffering.

28:10.040 --> 28:11.880
In retrospect,

28:12.920 --> 28:15.960
I, Su Muzhe, gained a foothold here

28:17.080 --> 28:19.320
because of Duanwu.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.600
How is it going between you and him?

28:32.080 --> 28:34.920
No one wants to elope with me.

28:36.320 --> 28:38.240
My fate is not as good as yours.

28:47.320 --> 28:48.760
My fate is good.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.360
You're back.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.320
Come here.

29:11.480 --> 29:12.760
Did you drink?

29:13.920 --> 29:15.000
I didn't.

29:20.760 --> 29:23.080
I've been waiting for you here
for a long time.

29:27.800 --> 29:29.240
You've been drinking.

29:29.760 --> 29:31.960
Have some porridge.

29:32.880 --> 29:35.400
This is to celebrate your survival.

29:35.480 --> 29:37.680
Zheng Shiyuan was put in jail.

29:37.760 --> 29:39.640
You will live

29:39.720 --> 29:41.680
a long and happy life.

29:42.440 --> 29:43.680
Did you make this?

29:53.240 --> 29:54.400
Is it delicious?

29:56.520 --> 29:57.640
Yes.

29:59.200 --> 30:00.440
Really?

30:01.160 --> 30:02.000
Yeah.

30:02.080 --> 30:03.080
Let me taste it.

30:03.680 --> 30:05.720
I refuse.

30:07.240 --> 30:08.080
It's great that it's delicious.

30:08.160 --> 30:11.280
The taste is not important.
Its meaning is important.

30:13.920 --> 30:14.760
What is it?

30:15.440 --> 30:16.600
I wish you a long life.

30:23.760 --> 30:24.800
People say,

30:25.320 --> 30:26.800
"Those who seek immortality cannot get it

30:27.320 --> 30:28.680
because life actually is short."

30:29.400 --> 30:31.560
Many people are seeking immortality.

30:32.840 --> 30:34.080
But I think

30:36.320 --> 30:37.360
it's best
if you make the most of the moment.

30:43.720 --> 30:46.400
Duanwu,

30:48.200 --> 30:50.320
I hope that whatever you do

30:50.400 --> 30:52.080
in the future,

30:53.560 --> 30:58.040
you will never be stumped
by anything or anyone,

30:59.840 --> 31:00.960
okay?

31:19.960 --> 31:21.120
Eat more.

31:31.760 --> 31:33.000
I'll eat it in my room.

31:33.080 --> 31:34.080
In your room?

31:37.120 --> 31:38.040
Careful.

31:59.000 --> 32:01.920
I just misappropriated
the membership fees.

32:02.440 --> 32:04.360
I will pay it back double.

32:04.880 --> 32:05.960
Zhang Jinran.

32:06.480 --> 32:09.800
Do you have proof that I kidnapped
and killed someone?

32:09.880 --> 32:10.960
Zheng Shiyuan.

32:12.400 --> 32:13.760
Do you think I have no proof?

32:13.840 --> 32:15.480
If you don't let me go,

32:15.560 --> 32:18.560
your reputation for justice
will be ruined in Yangzhou.

32:19.160 --> 32:21.600
Inspector Zhang seized a letter

32:21.680 --> 32:23.760
from Xu Nanying.

32:23.840 --> 32:24.880
It's useless to quibble.

32:26.600 --> 32:27.720
No way.

32:28.280 --> 32:29.960
He wasn't involved
in what happened back then.

32:30.040 --> 32:31.320
He didn't know anything.

32:31.400 --> 32:34.160
Tan sent Cui to do it.

32:36.080 --> 32:39.240
I ordered Zheng to clear it up.

32:40.280 --> 32:41.840
Li Kui can show his talents.

32:42.520 --> 32:45.960
I'm waiting for your good news.
You know who I am.

32:52.920 --> 32:56.000
If you are out to condemn somebody,
you can always trump up a charge.

32:57.080 --> 32:58.240
Zhang Jinran.

32:58.760 --> 33:00.560
If you really have proof,

33:01.320 --> 33:03.920
you should arrest Prince Ying.

33:04.880 --> 33:06.440
You don't have to come to me.

33:07.040 --> 33:10.480
I won't tell you anything.

33:17.320 --> 33:18.200
How dare you?

33:40.760 --> 33:43.520
Release Zheng Shiyuan tomorrow morning.

33:44.640 --> 33:46.120
You're looking for trouble.

33:47.920 --> 33:48.960
Put the word out

33:50.120 --> 33:51.480
that Zheng Shiyuan has confessed.

33:51.560 --> 33:53.160
Send more hands to keep an eye
on the Zheng's Mansion.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.080
I'll arrange it right away.

34:00.120 --> 34:02.480
Zheng Shiyuan was released?

34:02.560 --> 34:03.640
Yes.

34:07.040 --> 34:08.040
Lady Shijiu.

34:08.960 --> 34:10.000
Wait.

34:11.800 --> 34:14.199
Su Muzhe almost lost her life
trying to catch him.

34:14.920 --> 34:17.480
Yan Zijing and Zhang Jinran
were mad about it.

34:17.560 --> 34:19.719
They couldn't have let him go so easily.

34:20.679 --> 34:21.719
There must be a reason for this.

34:23.239 --> 34:24.840
A little impatience spoils great plans.

34:29.639 --> 34:30.960
Or…

34:34.199 --> 34:35.719
Do they want to use him as bait?

34:40.080 --> 34:41.600
Sneak into the Zheng's Mansion

34:42.320 --> 34:44.320
to keep an eye on Zheng Shiyuan.

34:44.400 --> 34:45.280
Don't make any mistakes.

34:46.440 --> 34:47.280
Yes, ma'am.

34:54.960 --> 34:57.280
Zheng Shiyuan.

34:59.040 --> 35:01.640
You've been a bully all your life.

35:02.160 --> 35:08.280
But you're just bait in the end.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.520
Come in.

35:44.520 --> 35:45.480
Mr. Yuchi.

35:46.000 --> 35:47.320
You've been busy for days.

35:47.400 --> 35:49.560
His Highness asked us
to make this soup for you.

35:49.640 --> 35:52.280
I told you I didn't want it. Take it away.

35:57.400 --> 35:59.960
Here are some pastries.

36:00.040 --> 36:03.440
I've said many times
that I like light food.

36:03.960 --> 36:05.240
Take them away.

36:11.280 --> 36:14.040
Here are fresh fruits from the West.
I'll put them here.

36:16.760 --> 36:17.880
We'll leave.

36:18.560 --> 36:19.480
Thank Prince Ying for me.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.800
Yes, sir.

36:23.960 --> 36:24.840
Your Highness.

36:26.000 --> 36:27.640
-You may leave.
-Yes, sir.

36:28.480 --> 36:29.560
Prince Ying.

36:40.120 --> 36:42.960
I've been good to Zhang Jinran
over the years,

36:43.040 --> 36:44.640
and I did my best to promote him.

36:46.120 --> 36:48.720
But he didn't care about it.

36:49.400 --> 36:50.840
Not only did he arrest Zheng Shiyuan,

36:52.040 --> 36:53.280
but he also said that he confessed

36:53.360 --> 36:54.920
and released him.

36:56.080 --> 36:57.960
He's doing it again.

36:58.040 --> 37:00.120
It's just Zheng Shiyuan.

37:00.200 --> 37:03.160
He dealt with money transactions.

37:03.240 --> 37:04.680
He didn't know what was going on.

37:04.760 --> 37:08.520
Even if he turns us in,

37:08.600 --> 37:09.600
he has no proof.

37:09.680 --> 37:12.560
Prince Ying, why are you so worried?

37:13.480 --> 37:15.040
I'm not worried about Zheng Shiyuan.

37:16.000 --> 37:17.760
It was all right that Su Muzhe didn't die.

37:17.840 --> 37:20.960
She smashed the blood-stained pearl
to lure Zheng Shiyuan to show up.

37:21.040 --> 37:22.480
I didn't expect

37:22.560 --> 37:25.320
Su Muzhe to incite merchants
in the jewelry guild

37:25.400 --> 37:28.000
to dismiss Zheng Shiyuan
as the guild head.

37:28.600 --> 37:30.040
And she smashed the blood-stained pearl.

37:34.560 --> 37:36.680
Su Muzhe knew

37:36.760 --> 37:38.720
that there was a treasure map

37:39.960 --> 37:41.760
in the pearl.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.440
How could she smash it so easily?

37:45.760 --> 37:49.080
I think it's fake.

37:50.640 --> 37:52.120
We thought the same.

37:52.720 --> 37:54.720
It's fake that she smashed
the blood-stained pearl.

37:54.800 --> 37:57.480
She wanted to declare
that she knew our weakness.

37:58.200 --> 38:02.440
The two pearls are about the treasure map.

38:02.960 --> 38:04.840
-Who would smash them?
-Yeah.

38:04.920 --> 38:07.320
They have the blood-stained pearl.

38:07.400 --> 38:08.520
For safety's sake,

38:10.960 --> 38:13.080
could you give your pearl to me

38:13.160 --> 38:15.400
for safekeeping?

38:17.520 --> 38:19.480
Prince Ying, you know I'm suspicious.

38:19.560 --> 38:21.520
I don't carry it around.

38:21.600 --> 38:22.640
You know

38:22.720 --> 38:25.360
it's about the Gulistan treasure.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.600
It's the most precious treasure
in the world.

38:28.720 --> 38:30.400
You are a prince.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.920
You grew up in the Central Plains.

38:32.000 --> 38:34.760
You don't know as much
about the Western Regions as I do.

38:35.480 --> 38:36.400
If you don't have me,

38:37.120 --> 38:41.000
it will be very difficult for you
to find the treasure.

38:43.280 --> 38:44.200
Prince Ying, don't worry.

38:44.280 --> 38:48.040
As long as I live here in peace,

38:48.120 --> 38:50.320
no matter what Zhang Jinran

38:50.400 --> 38:52.960
and Zheng Shiyuan do,

38:53.760 --> 38:56.480
the pearl will be safe.

39:00.520 --> 39:01.480
All right.

39:03.320 --> 39:04.800
It's better to keep still than move.

39:05.720 --> 39:10.120
Let's see what he will do.

39:11.680 --> 39:13.120
Prince Ying, you're brilliant.

39:14.200 --> 39:17.200
The only thing I told you
was to keep an eye on Lady Yu.

39:17.280 --> 39:18.760
How could she disappear?

39:19.760 --> 39:24.000
I fell asleep.
When I woke up, she was gone.

39:35.480 --> 39:38.200
Did she hear me talking to Garuda?

39:39.640 --> 39:40.960
She knew Zheng Shiyuan…

39:43.480 --> 39:44.480
No.

39:58.080 --> 39:59.800
LEDGER

40:07.400 --> 40:08.240
Prince Ying.

40:09.040 --> 40:10.560
If you don't protect me,

40:11.360 --> 40:12.880
I'll hand it over.

40:13.520 --> 40:15.240
Let's die together.

40:25.960 --> 40:27.120
Who's that?

40:27.200 --> 40:29.200
It's Yu.

40:29.280 --> 40:31.360
Master, I came back to serve you.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.440
Master.

40:43.760 --> 40:44.840
Master.

40:46.760 --> 40:47.920
Why are you back?

40:48.000 --> 40:49.160
I figured it out.

40:50.160 --> 40:51.720
Our son is dead.

40:52.440 --> 40:53.920
I only have you now.

41:02.520 --> 41:03.760
Master…

41:08.360 --> 41:10.240
Well. Tomorrow, I'll put you…

41:13.000 --> 41:15.360
I'll let you die with our son.

41:15.440 --> 41:16.960
How dare you do this?

41:17.480 --> 41:18.840
Get out!

41:20.320 --> 41:21.880
-What do you want?
-What do you want?

41:23.200 --> 41:25.080
Out of the way!

41:29.920 --> 41:31.400
Out of the way!

41:40.960 --> 41:42.960
Even if I die,
my ghost will haunt you down.

41:43.040 --> 41:44.920
I'll give you a lift. Die.

41:45.560 --> 41:46.920
Die!

41:58.080 --> 42:00.160
You evil woman.

42:16.400 --> 42:18.440
Do you want to kill me?

42:18.520 --> 42:20.880
I'll kill you first.
